OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer sacked after
OL,4,Acontacting sex workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Leicestershire Police constable has
OL,7,Fbeen sacked for contacting sex workers
OL,8,Fin order to live out a "fantasy".
OL,10,FOfficer A, who cannot be identified due
OL,11,Fto anonymity restrictions, contacted
OL,12,Fnine phone numbers associated with sex
OL,13,Fworkers listed online, a misconduct
OL,14,Fhearing was told on Wednesday.
OL,16,FHe admitted he sent messages between
OL,17,FNovember 2025 and April, but his
OL,18,Frepresentative Ryan Coleman argued they
OL,19,Fdid not constitute gross misconduct.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
