OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer sacked after
OL,4,Acontacting sex workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Chief Constable David Sandall ruled
OL,7,FOfficer A should be dismissed without
OL,8,Fnotice due to the repeated nature of
OL,9,Fthe texts being "exploitative" and the
OL,10,Fpotential for his behaviour to
OL,11,Fundermine public confidence.
